  "description": "Nexus.Pipeline is a typed, in-process execution pipeline for .NET. Register ordered steps — inline lambdas or DI-resolved class instances — attach middleware behaviors (logging, retry, timeout, transaction, OpenTelemetry metrics), and execute against a shared typed context. Results are structured: a PipelineResult carrying outcome, errors, and full step history. Includes saga compensation, conditional branching, parallel fan-out, topological step ordering, and Railway-Oriented result combinators. No external dependencies beyond Microsoft.Extensions.*. Supported frameworks: net462 · netstandard2.0 · net6.0 · net8.0 · net9.0 · net10.0. AOT/Trim compatible on net8.0 and above.",
